ENTRY            20480   20220214   20220822   20220720       2309
SUBENT        20480001   20220214   20220822   20220720       2309
BIB                  9         47
TITLE       Measurements of the neutron total cross-sections of
            Be,B-11,C,Al,Si,S,Ti,V,Ni,U-235,U-238,Pu-239 between
            100 keV and 6 MeV
AUTHOR     (J.Cabe, M.Cance,G.Bardolle,M.Laurat,M.Longueve)
INSTITUTE  (2FR BRC)
REFERENCE  (R,CEA-R-4524,1973)
            Summarizes some 10 year activity on measurements of
            the total cross-section of many isotopes in the
            energy range - hundreds keV to several MeV-.
           (P,EANDC(E)-150,80(3.1),1972)    Plots (B,AL,S,V)
           (P,EANDC(E)-140,1971)     Plots (Ni,235U,238U,239Pu)
           (C,70HELSINKI,2,31,1970)  Plots (C,Ni,235U,238U,239Pu)
           (J,JPR/C,31,C2-217,1970)  Plot  (Ti)
           (P,EANDC(E)-127,173,1970) Plots (Be,Ni,U,235U)
           (P,EANDC(E)-115,171,1968) Plots (S,Si,Ti)
           (P,EANDC(E)-89,220,1968) Plots (Ti,Si), Si res.param.
           (J,NP/A,102,92,1967)     Plots (V,Cr,Mn,Fe,Co)
           (R,CEA-R-3279,81,1967)   Plots (F,Al,Si,P,Cr,Pb,V,Mn,
                                             Fe,Ni,Co)
           (C,67BORDEAUX,1,36,1967) V,Cr,Mn,Fe,Co (No data/figs)
           (J,JPR,27,755,1966)      Plots (F,Al)
           (P,EANDC(E)-57,1965)     Plots (F,Al,V,Fe,Co,Ga,Pb)
           (J,CR,259,4616,1964)     Plot (Si)
           (J,CR,258,1478,1964)     Plot (Cr)
           (P,EANDC(E)-49,1963)     Data (S,Ni,C,Si,P,Cr,Mn)
FACILITY   (VDG,2FR BRC)  2 MeV Van de Graaff
           (VDGT,2FR BRC) 12 MeV tandem Van de Graaff
INC-SOURCE (P-T)  T(p,n)3He. Tritium absorbed in titanium.
DETECTOR   (SCIN) 1 x 1.5 inch cylindrical stilbene crystal
                  scintillator coupled with a 56 DVP 03
                  photomultiplier
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-T) Total error consists of the average quadratic
                   sum of the following contributions:
                   (The inelastic and multiple scattering in the
                    sample have been neglected.)
           (ERR-1) Background noise (about 1%)
           (ERR-2) Dead-time (about 1%)
           (ERR-3,1.,2.) Electronics (1-2%)
           (ERR-S,1.,2.) Statistics  (1-2%)
HISTORY    (19810415A) Data-table in 021 corrected and DATA-ERR
                       columns moved to COMMON sections
           (20100715A) On. BIB updated. SAMPLE added (002-025).
           (20120707U) SD: Keyword of ref. was changed:
             JPR/S -> JPR/C, 217 -> C2-217. ANALYSIS was deleted.
           (20181020U) SD: Page of ref. CR,259 corrected.
           (20220214A) SD: Page added to EANDC(E) reports.
           Subent 026 added.
ENDBIB              47
COMMON               2          3
ERR-1      ERR-2
PER-CENT   PER-CENT
 1.         1.
ENDCOMMON            3
ENDSUBENT           54
